{"name":"Baby Powder","hex":"#fefefa","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"baby powder","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An astringent powder used for preventing diaper rash, as a deodorant, and for other cosmetic purposes.","Cocaine."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/baby_powder"}],"entries":[{"title":"Baby powder","blocks":[{"text":"Baby powder is an astringent powder used for preventing diaper rash and for cosmetic uses. It may be composed of talc, corn starch or potato starch. It may contain additional ingredients such as fragrances. Baby powder can also be used as a dry shampoo, cleaning agent, and air freshener."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Johnsons_Baby_Powder_1%2C5_OZS_talc%2C_pic4.JPG/330px-Johnsons_Baby_Powder_1%2C5_OZS_talc%2C_pic4.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baby_powder"},{"title":"Infant","blocks":[{"text":"An infant is a very young human being. Baby is an alternative term for infant. The terms may also be used to refer to juvenile beings of other organisms. A newborn is, in mainstream use, an infant who is only hours, days, or weeks old; while in medical contexts, a newborn or neonate is an infant in the first 28 days after birth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4d/The_newborn_baby_in_men.jpg/330px-The_newborn_baby_in_men.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infant"},{"title":"Powder","blocks":[{"text":"A powder is a dry solid composed of many very fine particles that may flow freely when shaken or tilted. Powders are a special sub-class of granular materials, although the terms powder and granular are sometimes used to distinguish separate classes of material. In particular, powders refer to those granular materials that have the finer grain sizes, and that therefore have a greater tendency to form clumps when flowing. Granulars refer to the coarser granular materials that do not tend to form clumps except when wet."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Iron_powder.JPG/330px-Iron_powder.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Powder"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg/500px-Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg/1280px-Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg/500px-Baby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Traditional container for baby powder and puff in South India, made of silver","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABaby_Powder_and_puff_box_IMG_20210811_173820.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Daddy_Diaper_%28879097718%29.jpg/500px-Daddy_Diaper_%28879097718%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Daddy_Diaper_%28879097718%29.jpg/500px-Daddy_Diaper_%28879097718%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Baby powder might be applied after changing a diaper and cleaning the baby.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADaddy_Diaper_(879097718).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg/330px-Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Wo